  "description": "ProjectionLoom is a lightweight, high-performance object mapping library designed to simplify and accelerate data projection between different object models.\nUtilizing reflection and optimized caching, it provides seamless mapping capabilities for complex types with minimal configuration.\nIdeal for .NET developers who want an easy-to-use, flexible, and extensible mapper without the overhead of heavy dependencies.",
